-        <t indent="0" pn="section-b.1-2">To determine TAI corresponding to 2000-01-01T00:00:00Z
-(UNIX time = 946684800), the following procedure would be followed:</t>
-        <t indent="0" pn="section-b.1-3">1.  Find the latest leap-second occurrence prior to the time of
-    interest (leapsecond[21]) and note the correction value
-    (LEAPCORR = 22).</t>
-        <t indent="0" pn="section-b.1-4">2.  Add LEAPCORR + 10 to the time of interest to yield TAI of
-    2000-01-01T00:00:32.</t>
