+          <li pn="section-b.1-3.1" derivedCounter="1.">Find the latest leap-second occurrence prior to the time of
+interest (leapsecond[21]) and note the correction value
+(LEAPCORR = 22).</li>
+          <li pn="section-b.1-3.2" derivedCounter="2.">Add LEAPCORR + 10 to the time of interest to yield TAI of
+2000-01-01T00:00:32.</li>
